      "statement": "HO-3 2018-09 S.5 uses the Declarations deductible for each Section I loss, recognizes a separate windstorm/hail deductible where a state amendment requires it, and otherwise selects only the larger when both apply; HO 01 45 T.1 expressly amends S.5 for a Texas wind/hail loss.",
